<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A10.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In Appendix J Main results (extended) ‣ Actor-Curator: Co-adaptive Curriculum Learning via Policy-Improvement Bandits for Scalable RL Post-Training" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Model-agnostic behavior.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A10.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In Appendix J Main results (extended) ‣ Actor-Curator: Co-adaptive Curriculum Learning via Policy-Improvement Bandits for Scalable RL Post-Training" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Training efficiency.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
